  "description": "<p>This vibrant Pride Rainbow Doormat brings a welcoming touch to any home with its colorful artwork inspired by inclusivity, love, and positivity. Designed for both indoor and outdoor use, this doormat adds personality and warmth to your decor. It is a beautiful accent for entryways, patios, and porches, creating a cheerful aesthetic.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features a bright and colorful Pride design with rainbow-inspired artwork.</li>\n<li>Soft and durable material ensures a comfortable surface for everyday use.</li>\n<li>Vivid, long-lasting print adds personality to your living spaces.</li>\n<li>Suitable for both indoor and outdoor environments.</li>\n<li>Perfect for creating an inclusive home aesthetic in various styles.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Porch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>rainbow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Rainbow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Rubber</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile doormat is ideal for front doors, entryways, patios, porches, apartments, dorms, classrooms, and offices. Its durable design makes it suitable for both indoor and outdoor use, enhancing any space with its cheerful and inclusive aesthetic.</p>",
